translate ptBR qst_TwoEmperors_3_guardDebrief_2851dedb:

    # ALCOTT @ angry "As far as most people are concerned, the Demorai are just savage beasts ready to rip and tear."
    ALCOTT @ angry "Para a maioria das pessoas, os Demorai são apenas bestas selvagens prontas para rasgar e destruir."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_3.rpy:99
translate ptBR qst_TwoEmperors_3_guardDebrief_e7ea30f8:

