    ALCOTT @ talk "É melhor para o bem de todos mantermos assim."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_3.rpy:100
translate ptBR qst_TwoEmperors_3_guardDebrief_e22de872:

    # ALCOTT @ talk "Muddying the waters only invites unnecessary divisive discussions."
    ALCOTT @ talk "Turvar as águas só convida a discussões divisivas desnecessárias."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_3.rpy:105
translate ptBR qst_TwoEmperors_3_guardDebrief_rootMenu_8b289247:

    # ALCOTT @ talk "It is a soft lie that the Demorai are unintelligible savages."
    ALCOTT @ talk "É uma mentira suave que os Demorai sejam selvagens ininteligíveis."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_3.rpy:106
translate ptBR qst_TwoEmperors_3_guardDebrief_rootMenu_dc64c7cf:

